{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setshowpushnotificationalert:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in foreground."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setShowPushnotificationAlert:","title":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"show"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"show","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES to show alerts in foreground, NO to suppress them (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, iOS does not display notification banners when the app is in the foreground.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Enable this to show system notification alerts even when the app is active."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure based on app type:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class NotificationConfigManager {","","    func configureForAppType(_ appType: AppType) {","        switch appType {","        case .messaging:","            \/\/ Messaging apps typically handle notifications in-app","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        case .ecommerce, .news:","            \/\/ E-commerce and news apps benefit from showing all notifications","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(true)","","        case .game:","            \/\/ Games might want to suppress during gameplay","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","        }","    }","","    func temporarilyDisableForegroundAlerts(during action: () -> Void) {","        let wasEnabled = Pushwoosh.configure.getShowPushnotificationAlert()","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        action()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(wasEnabled)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pushwoosh.ForegroundPush"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setShowPushnotificationAlert:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setShowPushnotificationAlert:":{"title":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in foreground."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sets